<title>FRANCE: ONIC reports free-market grain bids.</title>
<headline>ONIC reports free-market grain bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain traders made the following bids for refunds to export free-market grain at this week's EU tender, French cereals office ONIC said. Bids are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- March 20 --		--- March 13 ---</p>
<p>		  Tonnage   Range of Bids    Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p> Soft wheat 1,097,500    8.73-17.99	521,200    8.48-16.39</p>
<p> Barley	 321,000   28.77-32.49	245,000   26.74-28.77</p>
<p> Rye		6,000   Not given		    No bids</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
